--- !u!114 &844150617328662560
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "The <b>XRI Network Player Avatar</b> prefab contains two different IK system components:\n   \xB7<b>XR Avatar IK (Script)</b>\n   \xB7<b>XR Hand Pose Replicator IK (Script)</b> \n\nThe <b>XR Avatar IK (Script)</b> component handles both the position and rotation for the avatar's torso and head rig.\n\nThe <b>XR Hand Pose Replicator IK (Script)</b> component handles hand pose replication over the network for both controller tracking and hand tracking."
--- !u!114 &1306760566008276047
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "The <b>XRI Network Player Avatar</b> prefab provides a simplified approach on how to set up and configure a networked player avatar.\n\nAll networked players require a <b>XRI Network Player (Script)</b> component attached to or derived from their network player prefab.\n\nBy default, this prefab utilizes dither materials to provide a comfortable experience, causing the avatar\u2019s materials to fade out when two or more players stand in close proximity to each other.\n\nInspect the <b>XR Avatar Visuals (Script)</b> to see how we subscribe to player options using:\n"
